 A7    HTR A7                .....N IS NON-POSITIVE.                    RRP20053
 A8    TSX RRP1,4            EXECUTE RRP1.                              RRP20054
 A6    PZE LP,,XXX                                                      RRP20055
       PZE N,,K                                                         RRP20056
       PZE M1,,M2                                                       RRP20057
       PZE INT2                                                         RRP20058
       NOP                                                              RRP20059
       SWT 1                 EJECT PAGE AT PRINTER IF SENSE SWITCH 1    RRP20060
       TRA A9                IS DOWN.                                   RRP20061
       WRS 241                                                          RRP20062
       PSE 241                                                          RRP20063
 A9    STO ER+5              GO TO A10 IF NORMAL RETURN OCCURRED.       RRP20064
       ARS 18                                                           RRP20065
       TZE A10                                                          RRP20066
       STO ER+6              WRITE OVERFLOW INDICATION.                 RRP20067
