       LXD ER,4              RESTORE REGISTER C.                        RRP20164
       TRA 1,4               RETURN TO CALLING SEQUENCE.                RRP20165
       REM SUBROUTINE TO CONVERT COEFFICIENT TO BINARY.                 RRP20166
 COEF  SXD ER+1,4            SAVE REGISTER C.                           RRP20167
       LXA I3,4              IF FIELD 1 IS NON-BLANK GO TO A301.        RRP20168
 A302  CLA INP+3,4                                                      RRP20169
       SUB BLANK                                                        RRP20170
       TNZ A301                                                         RRP20171
       TIX A302,4,1                                                     RRP20172
       LXD ER+1,4            RESTORE REGISTER C.                        RRP20173
       TRA 1,4               RETURN TO ALPHA+1.                         RRP20174
 A301  TSX FILE,4            CONVERT FIELD 1 TO BINARY.                 RRP20175
       MTW ER+2,,0118                                                   RRP20176
       HTR A301              .....ERROR RETURN.                         RRP20177
       LXA I3,4              IF FIELD 2 IS NON-BLANK GO TO A303.        RRP20178
 A304  CLA INP+6,4                                                      RRP20179
       SUB BLANK                                                        RRP20180
       TNZ A303                                                         RRP20181
       TIX A304,4,1                                                     RRP20182
       CLA ER+2              SET RIGHT ENDPOINT EQUAL TO LEFT ENDPOINT. RRP20183
       STO ER+3                                                         RRP20184
       TRA A305              GO TO A305.                                RRP20185
 A303  TSX FILE,4            CONVERT FIELD 2 TO BINARY.                 RRP20186
       MTW ER+3,,1936                                                   RRP20187
       HTR A303              .....ERROR RETURN.                         RRP20188
 A305  CLA ER+2              COMPENSATE LEFT ENDPOINT FOR CONVERSION    RRP20189
       TSX COMP1,4           ERROR AND STORE.                           RRP20190
       STO 0,2                                                          RRP20191
       CLA ER+3              COMPENSATE RIGHT ENDPOINT FOR CONVERSION   RRP20192
       TSX COMP2,4           ERROR AND STORE.                           RRP20193
       STO 1,2                                                          RRP20194
       CLA N                 N=N+1.                                     RRP20195
       ADD I1                                                           RRP20196
       STO N                                                            RRP20197
       TXI A306,2,-2         MODIFY REGISTER B.                         RRP20198
 A306  LXD ER+1,4            RESTORE REGISTER C.                        RRP20199
       TRA 2,4               RETURN TO ALPHA+2.                         RRP20200
       REM SUBROUTINE FOR LOWER COMPENSATION.                           RRP20201
 COMP1 TZE 1,4                                                          RRP20202
